<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="1">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="1" Title=""/>
      <Text>INT. Bathroom - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack is showering. He’s singing, or trying to sing a hip current </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">KCRW</Text>
      <Text> song. His entire outfit was tossed carelessly around the bathroom, chucks, skinny jeans with the belay holding his keys, one of those stupid tiny brimmed fedoras.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>His thick-rimmed glasses sit next to his moustache comb on the sink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack showers and scrubs his burly beard as he thinks aloud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Man, why did she have to work at Urban? I don’t think I can shop there anymore... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack switches to scrubbing his armpits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Not until Tonya gets fired!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack grabs his chest near his heart theatrically like a Meatloaf music video.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Damn you Tonya, RELEASE MY HEART!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The door in the bathroom outside the shower creaks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack alerts to attention, then quickly goes back to mumbling lyrics.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Life is a lemon... and I want. My. Money. Back!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>As Jack half-sings a shadow appears on the other side of the curtain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>In a flash, the curtain is torn open and the Scream killer stands opposite a soggy Jack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Dude....</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The killer holds up a formidable blade. Jack notices.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wait! This is so cliché that you’re attacking me in a shower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The killer lunges at Jack. Jack defiantly and nonchalantly slaps it away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Stop it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack ponders aloud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, if you’re going to attempt to kill me, you need to at least give me a good chase.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack lands on an idea he likes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ve gotta give me a chance to craft something wholly unique and original!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="2" Title=""/>
      <Text>Int. Bedroom - minutes later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack is slipping into his underwear. The killer enters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Whoa, now hang on here! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The killer actually does pause his assault.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>IS this the seventies? DO I look like a hot girl? NO?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack standing defiant, actually scolding this intruder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He motions to the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now wait for me out there!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The killer actually exits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack enters the bathroom, looks himself over, in full hipster gear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The killer enters the bathroom menacingly, Jack is already beaming a smile to himself in the mirror, he turns all grins to the killer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ok</Text>
      <Text>, let’s do this!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack and the killer chase each other through </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Silverlake</Text>
      <Text>, passing all the hipster </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">hotspots</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Intellegentsia</Text>
      <Text>, that other place, oh and the one that is always packed even though the food isn’t that good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack, pauses out of breath and the killer catches up and raises his knife and theatrically plunges it at Jack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack slaps it away just as nonchalantly as the first attempt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Stop it... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>In a split second, he lands on his next idea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ok</Text>
      <Text>, oh! Let’s go bug Tonya at work! Maybe I can win her heart back. Maybe get her fired too! Win win!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The killer lunges in with his knife life, Jack grabs his arm and yanks him forward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Come on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="3" Title=""/>
      <Text>INT. Urban OUtfitters - Moments LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tonya is folding clothes and chewing gum with a slack jaw and a Meatloaf song comes on in the store.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tonya laughs to herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tonya</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Heh</Text>
      <Text>, I “love” this song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tonya actually makes air quotes when she says love.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack busts in to the store and the killer follows. Jack is beaming with a huge smile as he barrels past Tonya.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Heh</Text>
      <Text>, yeah, he’s trying to kill me. No big deal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tonya shakes her head and goes back to folding and chewing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack stops, and thinks. The killer comes and attempts to jab his knife in Jack’ stomach. Jack flicks it away and stops to think.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hmm...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He comes to an idea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh. Steve!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack contemplates how much Steve annoys him and begins shaking his fist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>...Steve...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="4" Title=""/>
      <Text>INT. OFFICE building - momentS LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Steve is standing over a copy machine. As it operates he beats the side of it angrily.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Steve</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I just replaced your toner! Come on! What else can I give you? Blood? Do you want my blood?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack busts into the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Steve!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Steve turns around angrily, he sees Jack standing with a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">shit-eating</Text>
      <Text> grin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>STEVE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">What’re</Text>
      <Text> you so happy about?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh, what? Did I interrupt your important business meeting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Steve tilts his head down and angrily looks over to the copy machine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>STEVE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">...no</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack reaches his arm into the hallway and yanks in the killer for half a second then throws him back out of the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>He’s chasing me and totally trying to kill me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>STEVE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s like in those movies! People still do that!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Steve shakes his head and returns to abusing the copier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well... have fun with your boring-ass existence. You damned dirty necktie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Steve gets even angrier and kicks the copier as Jack jaunts out of the room. The killer darts after Jack a second later.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>MONTAGE of Jack being chased through the park, the killer swinging his blade near and Jack skipping along, happier than a pig in shit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The two on a roller coaster, the killer fumbling with his knife. A snapshot of the mid-huge-drop photo, a beautiful shot of Jack looking happier than his fifth birthday and the killer preparing to slam his blade through the top of Jack’ head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The sun is setting, Jack slows to a walk and turns as the killer approaches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Jack (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You know, I had the best day with you! Really, we should do this </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">agai-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Jack gets stabbed in the chest. And drops to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SMASH TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

